Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.34,0:00:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,(机密报告 主题:导致浣熊市意外的事件)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.25,0:00:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,在21世纪初叶 保护伞公司\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At the beginning of the 21st century, the Umbrella Corporation
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.66,0:00:43.12,Default,,0,0,0,,成为了美国最大的营利性组织\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}had become the largest commercial entity in the United States.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.20,0:00:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,每10个家庭中就有9个在使用他们生产的产品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nine out of every ten homes contain its products.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.26,0:00:50.26,Default,,0,0,0,,它在政治和经济上的触手伸及各个角落\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Its political and financial influence is felt everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.34,0:00:53.20,Default,,0,0,0,,对外而言它是世界上头号的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In public, it is the world's leading supplier
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.27,0:00:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,电脑设备 医疗及保健品供应商\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of computer technology, medical products and health care.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.21,0:00:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,但即使是它的许多雇员都不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unknown even to its own employees
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.44,0:01:02.97,Default,,0,0,0,,它主要的利润来源于军火\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}its massive profits are generated by military technology
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.05,0:01:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,基因试验以及生化武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}genetic experimentation and viral weaponry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.97,0:01:14.96,Default,,0,0,0,,《生化危机》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.06,0:02:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,所有保护伞员工任何时刻均须佩挂识别证\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All Umbrella staff must wear their identity tags at all times.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.06,0:03:03.87,Default,,0,0,0,,所有的放射物将于今天下午5点收集起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All radiation badges will be collected at 5:00 p.m. this afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.94,0:03:06.87,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢了! 上帝!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you! God!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.17,0:03:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,别人弄的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some people.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.71,0:03:12.87,Default,,0,0,0,,是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.91,0:03:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- 别给我看这本书 - 为什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Don't show this to me. - Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.74,0:03:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我很忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I'm busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.92,0:03:54.61,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么 火警演习\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's nothing. Fire drill.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.30,0:04:07.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 怎么回事? - 火警演习\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What is that? - Fire drill.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.80,0:04:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- 靠! - 嘿 到底怎么回事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Shit! - Hey, what the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.91,0:04:16.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 把电脑都盖起来! 把它拿开! - 他妈的 我正在干!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get the computers covered! Move it! - Damn it, I'm trying!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.64,0:04:18.61,Default,,0,0,0,,试验设备! 把它们拿开!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The experiments! Move them!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.69,0:04:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,门打不开吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shouldn't the doors open or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.36,0:04:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,电梯应该会把我们带到最近的楼层\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's supposed to take us to the nearest floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.87,0:04:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么回事?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.41,0:04:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,电话接不通\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Line's dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.08,0:04:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,- 出什么问题了? - 门开不开了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's the problem? - The doors won't open.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.25,0:04:57.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 后面那个门呢? - 也锁住了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What about the ones at the back? - Locked as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.12,0:04:59.98,Default,,0,0,0,,这里没有火灾! 没有火灾!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no fire here! No fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.49,0:05:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- 密码失效了! - 没有火灾!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- The code doesn't work! - No fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.49,0:05:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你们怎么了? - 门打不开!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's wrong with you? - The door won't open!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.86,0:05:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,而且水没有地方漏出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And this water isn't going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.39,0:05:10.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么? - 这房间是密封的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - It's a sealed room.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.90,0:05:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- 帮我开门! - 哦 该死的门!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Help me with the door! - Oh, fuck the doors!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.17,0:05:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须从这出去 到底怎么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to get out of here. What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.58,0:05:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,这种情况以前发生过吗? 我们必须从这出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Has this happened before? We have to get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.05,0:05:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们必须从这出去! - 别紧张\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We have to get out of here! - Take it easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.85,0:05:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你别紧张! - 安静!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You take it easy! - Quiet!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.06,0:05:39.65,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.54,0:05:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 上帝啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.37,0:06:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,毒气!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Halon!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.88,0:06:34.78,Default,,0,0,0,,停下!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.58,0:06:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,停下! 停!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop it! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.92,0:06:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,救命!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.35,0:07:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,让我看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.26,0:07:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一定要从这出去 跑出这幢大楼!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're going to have to get out of here. We have to get out of this building!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.16,0:07:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,这儿 帮我一把\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here, give me a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.40,0:07:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,这已经是最宽了 门卡住了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's as far as they'll go. They're caught on something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.60,0:07:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,够宽了 我能钻过去 然后找人帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's wide enough. I can squeeze through. I'll get help.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.48,0:07:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我卡住了 用力推\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm stuck. You're gonna have to push.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.32,0:07:47.78,Default,,0,0,0,,就这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.85,0:07:49.11,Default,,0,0,0,,再往外一点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A bit more.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.29,0:07:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么声音?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.03,0:07:57.76,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 上帝! 那是闸门的声音! 快出去!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, Christ! It's the brakes! Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.83,0:08:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我动不了了! - 我们必须从这出去!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I can't move! - We have to get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.97,0:08:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,把她推出去!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Push her out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.38,0:08:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,把我拉进去!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pull me back inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.84,0:08:14.28,Default,,0,0,0,,把我拉进去!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pull me back inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.76,0:11:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,有人吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.00,0:13:05.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你是谁? - 快走!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who are you? - Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.70,0:13:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,别碰我! 停下!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't touch me! Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.27,0:13:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- 离我远点! - 趴下!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get away from me! - Down!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.22,0:13:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你在干什么? 我是个警察!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing? I'm a cop!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.52,0:13:26.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我告诉过你 我是警察!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you, I'm a cop!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.76,0:13:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你要把我的手扭断了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're breaking my arm!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.21,0:13:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,报告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Report.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.71,0:13:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,快报告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Report now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.51,0:13:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.48,0:13:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫你报告 士兵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want your report, soldier.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.48,0:13:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道你在说什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.59,0:13:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,长官 房子内的主防御系统已经被启动了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, the house's primary defenses have been activated.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.09,0:14:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,她可能还在副作用的影响之下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's probably still suffering the side effects.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.76,0:14:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你们想干什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.23,0:14:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,那个警察怎么样?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about the cop?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.10,0:14:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,马修·艾迪生 找不到匹配档案\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Matthew Addison. I'm not getting a match.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.57,0:14:10.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你是谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.20,0:14:13.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我刚调来 他们可能还没建档\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just transferred. They probably don't even have me on file yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.50,0:14:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,本地警局缺人手 是有这可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The locals are inefficient. It's possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.61,0:14:17.80,Default,,0,0,0,,要把他关在这吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Should I secure him here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.85,0:14:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我们把他带走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. We take him with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.92,0:14:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你不能这样做!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.86,0:14:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,跟着我!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.43,0:14:36.19,Default,,0,0,0,,准备进入蜂巢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Prep for entry to the Hive.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.36,0:15:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,电力断了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Power's down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.66,0:15:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那就修好它 - 我来修\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So fix it. - I'm on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.76,0:16:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你弄完了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you done yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.92,0:16:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你太神经质啦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jumpy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.24,0:17:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,准备就绪!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stand clear!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.90,0:17:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你们有问题吗? - 那个门怎么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You got a problem? - How's that door?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.57,0:17:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- 被封死了 - 让我来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's sealed shut. - Let me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.42,0:17:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我神经质?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jumpy?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.76,0:18:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,躺着别动 躺着别动!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lie still. Lie still!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.83,0:18:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,看手电筒 眼睛跟着它转\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch this light. Follow it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.63,0:18:39.36,Default,,0,0,0,,- 现在告诉我这是几根手指? - 三根\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Now, how many fingers am I holding up? - Three.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.44,0:18:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.60,0:18:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,现在告诉我你叫什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now tell me your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.81,0:18:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.75,0:18:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,他没事 只是失忆了 就像那一位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's fine. Memory loss, just like the other one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.56,0:19:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,让我们把门打开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's open that door.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.41,0:19:59.71,Default,,0,0,0,,听我说 我想知道你们是谁\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen to me. I want to know who you people are
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.78,0:20:02.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你们在干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I want to know what's going on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.26,0:20:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,马上!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.86,0:20:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我们受雇于同一个老板\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You and I have the same employer.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.86,0:20:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都替保护伞公司干活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We all work for the Umbrella Corporation.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.03,0:20:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我们头上的大楼是蜂巢的紧急入口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The mansion above us is an emergency entrance to the Hive.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.40,0:20:19.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你是安排在那里保护入口的安全人员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are security operatives placed there to protect that entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.74,0:20:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,那这个呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.27,0:20:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你结婚是假的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your marriage is a fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.24,0:20:27.57,Default,,0,0,0,,只是你伪装的一部分 以保持蜂巢的隐秘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just part of your cover to protect the secrecy of the Hive.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.65,0:20:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,那什么是蜂巢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what is the Hive?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.71,0:20:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,给他们看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Show them.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.25,0:20:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,正在读取蜂巢的展示图\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Accessing schematic of the Hive.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.65,0:20:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,浣熊市 最近的市镇\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Raccoon City, nearest urban center.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.29,0:20:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我们发现你的那幢大楼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The mansion where we found you
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.29,0:20:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,从那里我们进入了火车\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and through which we gained access to the train
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.89,0:20:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,火车又带我们来到蜂巢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}which, in turn, brought us to the Hive.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.46,0:20:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,蜂巢位于地下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Hive itself is located underground
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.37,0:20:53.23,Default,,0,0,0,,在浣熊市地底深处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}deep beneath the streets of Raccoon City.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.94,0:20:56.87,Default,,0,0,0,,这是一个绝密的研究机构\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A top-secret research facility
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.94,0:20:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,由保护伞组织所有并运营\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}owned and operated by the Umbrella Corporation.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.61,0:21:04.45,Default,,0,0,0,,蜂巢内共有超过500名技术人员 科学家和后勤人员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Hive houses over 500 technicians, scientists and support staff.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.52,0:21:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在地下工作和生活\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They live and work underground.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.62,0:21:10.35,Default,,0,0,0,,他们的研究至关重要\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Their research is of the highest importance.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.42,0:21:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,但工作性质是保密的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Its nature is classified.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.96,0:21:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在地图上的位置由热感应点标出\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our position on the map is indicated by heat signature.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.14,0:21:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么我什么事都想不起来了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why can't I remember anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.81,0:21:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,蜂巢有自己的防御机制\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Hive has its own defense mechanisms
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.85,0:21:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,都由电脑操控\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}all computer-controlled.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.85,0:21:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,一种神经毒气被排放到了大楼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A nerve gas was released into the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.99,0:21:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,毒气的主要作用是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Primary effect of the gas
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.96,0:21:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,使吸入者完全昏迷4小时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}complete unconsciousness lasting anything up to four hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.99,0:21:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,其副作用是不定的 但是可能导致失忆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Secondary effects are varied, but can include acute memory loss.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.70,0:21:55.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- 持续多久? - 每个人都不一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- For how long? - Subjective.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.70,0:21:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,可能是一小时 一天或者一个星期\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}An hour, day, week.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.63,0:22:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你是说这个地方遭到了攻击?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you're saying this place was attacked?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.07,0:22:03.37,Default,,0,0,0,,恐怕状况还要更麻烦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm afraid things are a little more complicated than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.84,0:22:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,长官! 我们已经打通去蜂巢的通道了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir! We've breached the Hive.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.49,0:22:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,J.D.\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}J.D.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.68,0:22:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.50,0:23:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,毒气已经散了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Halon content has dissipated.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.72,0:23:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,这是用来改善地下工作环境的 就当成是地上的景象\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Makes it easier to work underground, thinking there's a view.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.41,0:23:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,看来我们要走楼梯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like we're taking the stairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.42,0:24:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- 报告情况 - 红皇后已锁定了我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Status. - Red Queen is locked onto us.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.36,0:24:04.29,Default,,0,0,0,,她知道我们在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She knows that we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.80,0:24:07.23,Default,,0,0,0,,红皇后是谁?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's the Red Queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.30,0:24:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,世界上最好的人工智能系统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}State-of-the-art a rtificial intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.30,0:24:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,她就是控制蜂巢的电脑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She is the computer that controls the Hive.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.88,0:24:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,这会拖慢我们的速度\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is gonna slow us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.82,0:24:32.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我们去皇后那儿的路上要经过这些实验室\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our route to the Queen takes us straight through these labs.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.32,0:24:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,雷恩 JD 去看看淹成什么样了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rain, J.D., see how bad the flooding is.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.69,0:24:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,卡普兰 去找一条别的路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kaplan, find us an alternate route.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.33,0:24:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,这里出什么事了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What happened here?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.27,0:24:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,5小时前 红皇后突然开始杀人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five hours ago, Red Queen went homicidal.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.77,0:24:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,她把蜂巢封锁起来后杀了里面所有的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sealed the Hive and killed everyone down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.81,0:24:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 天呐 - 当我们发现这里的状况后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Jesus. - When we realized what was happening
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.14,0:24:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我的小队就被派到这里来关掉她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}my team was dispatched to shut her down.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.48,0:24:57.81,Default,,0,0,0,,她为什么要这么做?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why did she do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.88,0:25:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,这我们也不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That we don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.52,0:25:03.68,Default,,0,0,0,,有可能是受到了外部操纵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But outside interference is a possibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.75,0:25:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,上帝!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.17,0:25:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 你还好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey. You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.51,0:25:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 给你 - 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Here. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.08,0:25:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我还好 - 拜托 穿上吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm fine. - Please, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.58,0:25:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这里很冷的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's cold in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.02,0:25:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.96,0:25:49.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你还记得以前的事吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you remember anything from before this?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.30,0:25:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,不 火车上之前的事什么都记不得了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Nothing before the train.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.54,0:25:59.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.68,0:26:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,不 什么都记不得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.72,0:26:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我找到了另一条路 但要花不少时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I found an alternate route, but it's gonna cost us time.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.65,0:26:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我们绕回去 穿过B餐厅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We double back, cut through Dining Hall B
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.32,0:26:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,然后从这里直达目的地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}then we're right on track.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.11,0:26:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,长官 没路了 整层都被淹了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, no go. The whole level's flooded.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.48,0:26:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我们的进度已经落后了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, we're behind schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.14,0:26:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,所以行动起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So let's move it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.82,0:26:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.19,0:26:52.13,Default,,0,0,0,,可怜的混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Poor bastards.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.41,0:27:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,B餐厅\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dining Hall B.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.34,0:27:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,地图上是这么说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what it says on the map.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.85,0:27:46.04,Default,,0,0,0,,也许你看错了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe you're reading it wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.12,0:27:49.68,Default,,0,0,0,,也许公司在这里藏了一些秘密\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe the corporation's keeping a few secrets down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.75,0:27:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,一些你不该看的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Something you're not supposed to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.49,0:27:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,JD 你和雷恩看着犯人然后守住出口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}J.D., you and Rain keep the prisoner here and secure the exit.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.86,0:27:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,长官 这件房间的毒气显示为零\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir, halon levels are nonexistent in this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.83,0:28:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我想系统失灵了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think the system malfunctioned.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.33,0:28:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,好 可能还有幸存者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. There may be survivors.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.87,0:28:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,搜索一下 但别散了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me a search line, but keep it tight.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.74,0:28:11.17,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.33,0:29:05.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我说了别散了 - 对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I said keep it tight. - Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.06,0:29:11.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我不太确定我还能不能回忆起这下面的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not sure I want to remember what went on down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.17,0:29:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,这不怪你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't blame you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.14,0:29:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在这里面保存了什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do they keep in these things?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.14,0:29:22.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我怎么会知道?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.27,0:29:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么用了那么久?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's taking so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:49.04,0:29:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,红皇后的防御系统十分完备 我们要完成任务很困难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Red Queen's defenses are in place. She's making it difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.78,0:29:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,先别弄了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's pack it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.96,0:30:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,你待在这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.03,0:30:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,自动感应灯 没什么可担心的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The lights are automated. Nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.95,0:31:12.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- 传输器就位 - 收到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Transmitter in position. - Roger.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.12,0:31:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,正在解码\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Running the bypass.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.61,0:31:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,将\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Checkmate.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.39,0:31:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move up.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.56,0:31:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那是什么东西? - 那是我们关闭皇后用的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What is that? - That's what will shut the Queen down.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.66,0:31:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,它能放出一道强大的电流\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Delivers a massive electrical charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.67,0:31:58.76,Default,,0,0,0,,扰乱主机并迫使它重启\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Scrambles the mainframe and forces it to reboot.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.55,0:32:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,某种休眠状态防卫机制\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some kind of dormant defense mechanism.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.58,0:32:13.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- 打开门就会启动它 - 让它继续休眠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Opening the door tripped it. - Put it back to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.35,0:32:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我正在处理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Working on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.69,0:32:20.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你能把门打开吗? - 我正在试\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Would you open that door now, please? - I'm trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.82,0:32:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,待在自己的位置 大家都冷静下来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold your positions. Everyone stay calm.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.89,0:32:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.70,0:32:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- 卡普兰 快! - 我们得让他们从里边出来!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Kaplan, quick! - We gotta get them out of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.77,0:32:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- 卡普兰 你得快点! - 快啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Kaplan, you've gotta hurry! - Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.14,0:32:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,趴下! 快趴下!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Down! Get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.17,0:32:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,- 当心! 某种东西正在杀死他们! - 天呐! 快点啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Look out! Something's killing them! - Jesus! Come on, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.27,0:32:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,别对我那样!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't do this to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.94,0:32:42.81,Default,,0,0,0,,医务兵! 医务兵!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Medic! Medic!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.86,0:32:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快打开门! - 快打开这道门!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Open the door! - Open this door!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.69,0:32:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我正在试 - 保持清醒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I am trying. - Stay conscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.99,0:32:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你会休克的 保持清醒!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're going into shock. Stay awake!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.83,0:33:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我快完成了 - 长官! 它又回来了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I am almost there. - Sir! It's coming back!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.03,0:33:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 打开门! - 我正在试!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Open the door! - I'm trying!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.70,0:33:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,那就再努力点儿!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, try harder!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.50,0:33:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,它又回来了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's coming back!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.15,0:33:18.01,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 我的天!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.08,0:33:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 就那么做! - 我快完成了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Just do it! - I'm almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.62,0:33:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,快些!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.52,0:33:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- 混蛋! - 好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Shit! - Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.48,0:33:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.38,0:33:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我们继续\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.35,0:33:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,干什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do what?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.62,0:33:59.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得完成任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to complete the mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.96,0:34:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不去那种鬼地方\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is no way I'm going down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.33,0:34:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,她的防御系统已经关了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Her defenses are down.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.50,0:34:07.43,Default,,0,0,0,,之前也是这样 不是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Déjà vu, anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.69,0:35:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,继续前进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.73,0:35:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,帮我一把\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me a hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.18,0:36:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,出去! 出去! 你们不能进来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out! Get out! You can't be in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.18,0:36:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,别相信她说的任何话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't listen to anything she says.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.05,0:36:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,她是红皇后的全息影像\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's a holographic representation of the Red Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.35,0:36:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你们必须出去!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.99,0:36:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,是模仿首席程序师的女儿做的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Modeled after the head programmer's daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.22,0:36:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,她会欺骗我们 迷惑我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She'll try to deceive us, confuse us.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.49,0:36:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,我不建议你们这样做 关闭我会导致主电源断电\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wouldn't advise this. Disabling me will result in loss of primary power.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.10,0:36:23.29,Default,,0,0,0,,她会想尽一切办法来阻止我们关了她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She'll say anything to stop us from shutting her down.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.37,0:36:25.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我恳求你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I implore you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.70,0:36:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- 请你让开吧 - 求求你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Implore away. - Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.94,0:36:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,求求你们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.54,0:36:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,你们都会死在这里的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're all going to die down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.81,0:37:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,这个脉冲能迫使断路器切断她的主机30秒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That pulse forces the circuit breaker to shut down her mainframe for 30 seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.48,0:37:43.88,Default,,0,0,0,,在这之后 如果我没有找到她的主板 她就会重启\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After that, if I don't have her board, she can reboot.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.82,0:37:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,他们迟到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're late.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.40,0:38:05.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我去看看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.55,0:38:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,JD 发现一个幸存者!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}J.D., we got a survivor!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.35,0:38:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,没事了 我们是来帮助你们的.\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay. We're here to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.56,0:39:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你好像伤得很重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You seem to be in some serious
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.23,0:39:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,别靠近我! 别靠近我!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get off of me! Get off of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.97,0:39:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,JD 在我发火前最好让她离开!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}J.D., get her off of me before I stab her ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.91,0:39:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.78,0:39:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,她咬我了 她从我这儿咬去了一大块肉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She bit me, man. She took a chunk clean right out of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.68,0:39:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,趴下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay down.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.12,0:39:28.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我在警告你 趴下!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm warning you, stay down!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.89,0:39:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,她疯了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.89,0:39:34.45,Default,,0,0,0,,再往前一步 我就开枪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come any closer, and I'll fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.36,0:39:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我是认真的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean it!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.86,0:39:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,去死吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Damn you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.82,0:40:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我打了她5枪 她怎么还能站着?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I shot her five times. How was she still standing?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.22,0:40:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,贱逼现在没法站着了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bitch isn't standing now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.93,0:40:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,- 枪声是怎么回事? - 我们发现了一个幸存者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What was all the shooting? - We found a survivor.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.80,0:40:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你向他开了枪? - 她疯了 她居然咬我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And you shot him? - She was crazed. She bit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.44,0:40:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,她不见了 她不见了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's gone. She's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.34,0:40:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,胡说八道!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's bullshit!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.71,0:40:29.44,Default,,0,0,0,,她就倒在那 但她现在不见了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She fell right here, but she's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.38,0:40:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,看 看这个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.38,0:40:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,这里有血 但不多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's blood, but it's not much.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.35,0:40:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,看上去已经凝结了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks like it's coagulated.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.99,0:40:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 那不可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. - It's not possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.66,0:40:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.56,0:40:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,因为只有死后血才会这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because blood doesn't do that till after you're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.03,0:40:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可以走了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can we go now?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.87,0:40:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,在其他组员过来之前 我们哪儿也不去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not going anywhere till the rest of the team get here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.64,0:41:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没人会来了 - 你他妈说什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There's no one else coming. - What the fuck are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.21,0:41:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.22,0:41:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,安静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.69,0:41:45.24,Default,,0,0,0,,妈的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.32,0:41:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,别再过来了! 他们在我们后面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't come any closer! They're behind us.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.06,0:41:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,上帝啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.26,0:41:53.49,Default,,0,0,0,,他们到处都是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.13,0:41:56.53,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们 他们到处都是 他们把我们包围了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Guys, they're everywhere. They're all around us.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.62,0:42:21.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我说过了给我退后!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.60,0:42:32.57,Default,,0,0,0,,他们怎么打不死?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why aren't they dying?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.08,0:42:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,当心那些培养槽! 培养槽!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch the tank! The tank!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.62,0:42:53.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们走吧! - 快点!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let's go! - Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.66,0:42:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 等等! - 快 我们走吧!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Wait! - Come on, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.46,0:42:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快点啊! - 别停! 快!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Move! - Keep moving! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.03,0:43:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,走!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.85,0:43:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以帮你拿到病毒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can help you get the virus.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.68,0:43:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我能搞到安全密码 监控图 还有计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have access to security codes, surveillance plans, the works.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.67,0:43:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,妈的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.21,0:43:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们跟其他人走散了! - 继续走!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We lost the others! - Keep moving!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.59,0:44:01.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你在等吗? - 不知道密码\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You waited? - Didn't know the code.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.96,0:44:03.72,Default,,0,0,0,,快 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.79,0:44:05.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- 妈的! - 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Shit! - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:19.74,0:44:21.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快 - 快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on. - Hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.14,0:44:22.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快点伙计 - 见鬼!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on, man. - Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.41,0:44:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- 怎么用了这么久? - 我正在试!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's taking so long? - I'm trying!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.03,0:44:45.09,Default,,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.00,0:44:49.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 起开! 密码是什么? - 赶快!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Move! What's the code? - Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.07,0:44:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我子弹快打光了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm running out of ammo!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.74,0:44:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,0 4 3 2 不 5!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Zero, four, three, two. No, five!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.51,0:44:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么? - 0 4 3…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - Zero, four, three...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.38,0:44:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 密码是什么? - 0 4…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What is the code? - Zero, four...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.58,0:45:02.14,Default,,0,0,0,,…0 3 1…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}...zero, three, one...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.22,0:45:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,…9 6 5\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}nine, six, five.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.89,0:45:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- 搞定了? - 看 这多简单\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Got it? - See how easy that was?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.19,0:45:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- 靠! - J.D. 不!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Shit! - J.D., no!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.06,0:45:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,抓住我的手 伙计! 快!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Grab my hand, man! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.30,0:45:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,别放手!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.04,0:45:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,- J.D.! - 雷恩!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- J.D.! - Rain!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.66,0:46:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,尸体到哪去了? 它们去哪儿了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where are the bodies? Where did they go?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.73,0:46:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,操!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.00,0:46:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,不管它们是什么 外面那些都太多了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever they are, there's too many of them out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.50,0:46:32.41,Default,,0,0,0,,他们是什么还用问吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever they are? It's pretty obvious what they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.47,0:46:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,实验服 徽章 这些人之前就在这里工作!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lab coats, badges. Those people used to work here!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.15,0:46:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,所有在这里工作的人都死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All the people working here are dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.65,0:46:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,那也没能阻止它们到处游荡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that isn't stopping them from walking around.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:41.68,0:46:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,它们是从哪来的? 为什么进来的时候没看到它们?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, where did they come from? Why didn't we see them on the way in?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.32,0:46:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,当你切断电源的时候 门都打开了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you cut the power, you unlocked the doors.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.09,0:46:49.49,Default,,0,0,0,,是你让它们出来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You let them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.74,0:47:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,我们永远到不了地面了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're never gonna make it to the surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.46,0:49:05.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你是安全人员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are security operatives.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.63,0:49:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,安排在那里保护入口的安全人员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Security operatives placed there to protect that entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.33,0:52:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我的枪上了子弹 还剩一个弹夹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've got one in the breech and an extra mag.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.49,0:52:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,丽莎?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lisa?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.16,0:53:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以帮你拿到病毒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can help you get the virus.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.29,0:53:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我能搞到安全密码 监控图 还有计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have access to security codes, surveillance plans, the works.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.56,0:53:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,但是?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.36,0:53:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- 但是需要一些价码 - 说吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But there's gonna be a price. - Name it.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:21.24,0:53:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- 她是谁? - 我妹妹\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who was she? - My sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.35,0:53:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,像保护伞这样的公司以为他们凌驾于法律之上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Corporations like Umbrella think they're above the law.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.33,0:53:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,但不是这样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But they're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:43.86,0:53:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我们有千千万万的人有着同样的想法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are hundreds of thousands of us who think the same
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.17,0:53:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,遍及全世界\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}all over the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.11,0:53:54.63,Default,,0,0,0,,一些人提供情报\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some of us provide information
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.54,0:53:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,其他的给予支援\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}others give their support.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.61,0:54:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,一些人直接采取行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Some take more direct action.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.05,0:54:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,比如你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.69,0:54:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你的朋友们再细心一点的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If your friends had been a little more thorough
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.82,0:54:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,他们就能识破我的假ID了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they would've seen right through my false ID.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.96,0:54:15.19,Default,,0,0,0,,那么所有警报都会被拉响\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then all the red flags would've gone off
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.26,0:54:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,匡蒂科 国安局 FBI暴力犯罪逮捕项目 还有其他这些\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quantico, NSA, ViCAP, all the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.57,0:54:23.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有办法混入蜂巢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's no way I could've infiltrated the Hive.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.04,0:54:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你让你妹妹来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you sent your sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.14,0:54:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我们需要一些确凿的证据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We needed something concrete.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.41,0:54:36.31,Default,,0,0,0,,能把保护伞曝光给媒体的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anything to expose Umbrella to the press.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.38,0:54:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,关于地下研究的证据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Proof of the research that was going on down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.12,0:54:42.09,Default,,0,0,0,,什么样的研究?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What kind of research?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.16,0:54:43.99,Default,,0,0,0,,非法的那种\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The illegal kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.63,0:54:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,基因研究\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Genetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.16,0:54:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,病毒研究\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Viral.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.30,0:54:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我妹妹想偷带出去一份\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My sister was going to smuggle out
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.10,0:54:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,他们正在研发的病毒样本\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a sample of the virus they were developing.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.14,0:55:03.67,Default,,0,0,0,,那她到底要怎么带出去?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So how was she going to make it out of here?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.74,0:55:08.51,Default,,0,0,0,,她在蜂巢里有一个内线 我从来没见过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She had a contact within the Hive, someone I never met.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.58,0:55:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,他们能弄到保安密码 监控 她需要的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They had access to security codes, surveillance, everything she needed.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.65,0:55:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,那她为什么失败了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So why didn't she make it?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.96,0:55:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,可能她信错人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe she trusted the wrong person.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.46,0:55:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,可能他们给她下了个套\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe they set her up.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.83,0:55:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,把病毒据为己有了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kept the virus for themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.13,0:55:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道在黑市上T病毒值多少钱吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you know how much the T-virus would be worth on the open market?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.24,0:55:36.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 什么 不惜以这样的代价? - 是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What, worth all this? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.48,0:55:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,对某些人来说是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.95,0:55:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,别开枪! 别开枪!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't shoot! Don't shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.49,0:55:50.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- 关上门! - 它们就在后面!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Close that door! - They're right behind us!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.53,0:55:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,放开! 放开!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get off!. Get off!.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.20,0:55:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,不要!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.63,0:56:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,狗娘养的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Son of a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.03,0:56:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你还好吧? - 嗯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You okay? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.07,0:56:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,就在我们后面 那这扇门呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right behind us. What about this door?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.07,0:56:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- 它们就在外面等着呢 - 那条路呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- They're waiting out there too. - And that way?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.58,0:56:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,这是死路 皇后的主机房没有出口\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a dead end. There's no way out of the Queen's chamber.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.22,0:56:16.44,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们就等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So we wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.52,0:56:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,如果收不到你的消息 他们一定会派支援什么过来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If someone doesn't hear from you, they'll send backup or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.52,0:56:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,对吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.23,0:56:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么? 有什么问题吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What? What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.50,0:56:30.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我们没有时间了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't have much time.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.66,0:56:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你记得我们从大楼来这的路上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know those blast doors we passed
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.73,0:56:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,经过的那些防爆门吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}on the way in from the mansion?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.77,0:56:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,它们在一小时内就要被锁死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They seal shut in just under an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.80,0:56:40.90,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们那时候还没出去 就出不去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we're not out of here by then, we're not getting out.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.97,0:56:44.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你在说什么? 他们不能把我们就活埋在这啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you talking about? They can't just bury us alive down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:48.38,0:56:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,这是唯一的保险措施\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Containing the incident is the only fail-safe plan they had
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.58,0:56:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,为了防止任何泄露\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}against possible contamination.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.19,0:57:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,而你到现在 我们被困在他妈地下半英里深的地方的时候\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you're only telling us this now, when we're trapped
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.03,0:57:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,才告诉我们这些?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}half a fucking mile underground?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:03.96,0:57:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须找到一条路离开这个房间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to find a way out of this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.90,0:57:09.99,Default,,0,0,0,,你在干什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.11,0:57:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你要拿那些东西去哪? - 我要重启她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where are you taking those? - I'm turning her back on.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.11,0:57:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这不是个好主意 - 她知道怎么离开这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That is not a good idea. - She'll know a way out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.65,0:57:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,那疯子杀了我的队友\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That homicidal bitch killed my team.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.42,0:57:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,那疯子可能是我们离开这儿的唯一方法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That homicidal bitch may be our only way out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.66,0:57:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,想想她受到的这些待遇 我确定她会非常乐意帮我们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Considering the way she's being treated, I'm sure she'll be real happy to help us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.83,0:57:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你之前说的那个断路器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That circuit breaker you were talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.00,0:57:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你能解开它吗? - 可以\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can you bypass it? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.60,0:57:40.03,Default,,0,0,0,,那就动手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.67,0:57:49.04,Default,,0,0,0,,搞定 断路器终止了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, circuit breaker is disabled.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.11,0:57:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,如果这次我再按下这个开关 她就不会被关闭了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This time if I hit the switch, she won't be able to shut down.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.75,0:57:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,她会被烧焦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's gonna fry.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.68,0:57:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,卡普兰?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kaplan?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.69,0:58:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,肯定是启动电压把电路板烧坏了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The initial charge must have damaged her boards.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.86,0:58:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 原来你们在这\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ah, there you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.19,0:58:07.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我收集的东西已经失控了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Things, I gather, have gone out of control.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.46,0:58:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,快把那他妈的开关给我 我要把你屁股给烧了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me that fucking switch right now. I'm gonna fry your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.10,0:58:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我警告过你了 不是吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I did warn you, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.33,0:58:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我们下面发生什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell us what's going on down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:15.60,0:58:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,研究和开发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Research and development.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.74,0:58:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,那T病毒是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about the T-virus?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.54,0:58:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,T病毒是医药科学上的一大突破\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The T-virus was a major medical breakthrough
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.04,0:58:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,不过它也具有极为有利可图的军事价值\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}although it clearly also possessed highly profitable military applications.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.62,0:58:30.55,Default,,0,0,0,,那这又跟外面那些东西有什么关系呢?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How does it explain those things out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.62,0:58:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,就算在死亡状态下 人体也能保持活性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Even in death, the human body still remains active.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.85,0:58:35.79,Default,,0,0,0,,头发跟指甲会继续生长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hair and fingernails continue to grow.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.52,0:58:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,新细胞会产生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}New cells are produced
Dialogue: 0,0:58:38.36,0:58:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,而大脑本身也还保持着微弱的电流\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the brain itself holds a small electrical charge
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.46,0:58:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,直到几个月后才消失.\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that takes months to dissipate.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.33,0:58:46.89,Default,,0,0,0,,T病毒不论是对细胞生长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The T-virus provides a massive jolt
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.97,0:58:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,还是对微弱电流脉冲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}both to cellular growth
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.97,0:58:51.90,Default,,0,0,0,,都会产生巨大的冲击\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and to those trace electrical impulses.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.97,0:58:53.87,Default,,0,0,0,,简单来说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Put quite simply
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.94,0:58:56.41,Default,,0,0,0,,它重新激活了人体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it reanimates the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.48,0:58:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,死而复生?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It brings the dead back to life?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.85,0:59:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不完全是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not fully.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.48,0:59:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,它们只拥有最简单的行动能力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The subjects have the simplest of motor functions.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.22,0:59:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,可能加上少许的记忆 事实上没有任何智能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps a little memory. Virtually no intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.99,0:59:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,它们被最基本的神经冲动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They are driven by the basest of impulses
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.76,0:59:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,最原始的需求驱动着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the most basic of needs.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.09,0:59:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,什么需求?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Which is?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.26,0:59:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,食欲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The need to feed.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.07,0:59:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,要怎么杀了它们?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you kill them?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.67,0:59:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,击断颈椎或者重创大脑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Severing the top of the spinal column or massive trauma to the brain
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.31,0:59:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,是最有效的方法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}are the most effective methods.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.31,0:59:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你意思是爆头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You mean shoot them in the head.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.08,0:59:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么你要把这下面的人都杀了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why did you kill everybody down here?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.08,0:59:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,T病毒已经侵入了空调通风系统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The T-virus escaped into the air conditioning system
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.92,0:59:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,开始了无法控制的传染模式\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and an uncontrolled pattern of infection began.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.49,0:59:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,病毒具有很强的变异性\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The virus is protean
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.36,0:59:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,会由液体传染变为空气传染再到血液传染\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}changing from liquid to airborne to blood transmission
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.99,0:59:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,依环境而定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}depending on its environment.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.36,0:59:51.89,Default,,0,0,0,,它几乎不可消灭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's almost impossible to kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.97,0:59:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能让它从蜂巢里扩散出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I couldn't allow it to escape from the Hive
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.07,0:59:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我采取了措施\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so I took steps.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.77,1:00:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,- 措施 - 你一定要理解\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Steps. - You must understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.44,1:00:04.81,Default,,0,0,0,,被传染的人 我决不能让你们离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those who become infected, I can't allow you to leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.88,1:00:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,哗 我们又没被感染\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whoa. We're not infected.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.01,1:00:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,仅仅是那些生物的一次咬伤或抓伤 也足以让你受到感染\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just one bite, one scratch from these creatures is sufficient
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.02,1:00:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,然后你会变成它们中的一员\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and then you become one of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.62,1:00:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,系统检查显示我的主驱动断路器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A check of my systems indicates my main drive circuit breaker
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.99,1:00:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,被关掉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}has been disabled.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.20,1:00:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我能问为什么吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}May I ask why?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.20,1:00:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,留一手 我们需要离开这的方法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Insurance. We need a way out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.77,1:00:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,假如你拒绝帮忙的话 我们随时可以制服你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you refuse to help at any time, we flip the switch.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.77,1:00:32.83,Default,,0,0,0,,懂了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Understand?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.28,1:00:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你先走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.33,1:00:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么鬼地方?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the hell is this place?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.36,1:00:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,设备管道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The utility tunnels.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.73,1:01:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,它们在蜂巢下面 用来送水 气和电线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They run underneath the Hive for water, gas and power lines.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.35,1:01:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们来过这里 - 继续走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's been in here before. - Keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.65,1:01:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们在绕圈吧 - 这就是电脑给我们的路线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We're going around in circles. - This is the route the computer gave us.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.55,1:01:22.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你怎么还听她的? - 够了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why are you listening to her? - Enough already!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.12,1:01:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只能不停往前走因为它们就在我们后面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have no choice but to keep moving 'cause those things are right behind us.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.50,1:01:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那网子根本挡不住他们 - 快走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That mesh isn't gonna hold. - Keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.40,1:01:41.31,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊! 停! 它们太多了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jesus Christ! Hold it! There's too many of them!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.28,1:01:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- 天啊! - 妈的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Jesus! - Fuck!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.99,1:02:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,快爬到管子上去 快爬到管子上去!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Up on the pipes. Up on the pipes!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.66,1:02:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,快啊 大家!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Quickly, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.03,1:02:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- 走啊! - 走吧! 上面有条路!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Let's go! - Come on! There's a way up!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.03,1:02:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,小心! 挡住它们!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Watch out! Keep 'em back!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.54,1:02:12.50,Default,,0,0,0,,快上去! 快啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go on up! Move it!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.78,1:02:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,妈的 好吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shit. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.75,1:02:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,来这儿! 它们太多了! 来啊! 走 走 走!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get over here! There's too many of them! Come on! Go, go, go!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.39,1:02:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,走啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go on!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.63,1:02:36.72,Default,,0,0,0,,走! 走! 我能应付!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go! Go! I can manage!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.77,1:02:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,,抓住你了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gotcha!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.74,1:03:21.60,Default,,0,0,0,,雷恩?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rain?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.67,1:03:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,雷恩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rain.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.04,1:03:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,干吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.21,1:03:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你的伤口要赶快治疗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to do something about your wounds.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.05,1:03:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.25,1:03:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我说了我没事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I said I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.99,1:03:43.29,Default,,0,0,0,,哼? 你们很喜欢 对不对? 哈?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hm? You like that, don't you? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.16,1:03:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你们喜欢血的味道 对吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You like the way it tastes, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:49.67,1:03:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,喜欢那股味道?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like the taste of that?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.51,1:04:00.95,Default,,0,0,0,,她是对的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She was right.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.28,1:04:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我们全都要死在这下面了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're all gonna die down here.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.29,1:04:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我们一定可以出去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. We're getting out.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:09.12,1:04:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,所有的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.20,1:04:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,卡普兰 还好吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kaplan, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.95,1:05:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 天啊!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.53,1:05:26.33,Default,,0,0,0,,支持住!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.14,1:05:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- 帮帮他 - 我没办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Help him. - I can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.78,1:05:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你在等什么? - 我瞄不准!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What are you waiting for? - I can't focus!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.12,1:05:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我看不见!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't see!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.13,1:05:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- 卡普兰 往上走! - 快上去!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Kaplan, go up! - Get up there!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.00,1:06:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你就快到了 继续走!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You almost got it. Keep going!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.43,1:06:03.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 加油! 加油! - 你行的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on! Come on! - You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.74,1:06:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,你做到了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You got it!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.24,1:06:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好了 卡普兰 - 只管待在那!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Okay, Kaplan. - Just stay there!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.91,1:06:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,坚持住 我们会来接你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on. We're gonna come get you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.08,1:06:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,把这线剪了扔给他 然后我们就可以过去接他了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cut this wire and throw it to him. Then we can go get him.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.98,1:06:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,撑住!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.36,1:06:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,还真走运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's lucky.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.93,1:06:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,你们走吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.77,1:06:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们不会丢下你的 卡普兰 - 不 你们走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We're not leaving you, Kaplan. - Yes, you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.87,1:06:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你杀不完它们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can't kill all of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.81,1:06:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,那我也逃不了了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'm not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.61,1:06:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你们走吧 快!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to go. Now!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.41,1:06:47.57,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.65,1:06:49.55,Default,,0,0,0,,只管走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.18,1:06:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,只管快点走!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just do it now!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.52,1:06:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.09,1:06:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,走!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:25.32,1:07:28.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我可不会这么简单就给你们吃的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna have to work for your meal!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.89,1:08:01.25,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.30,1:08:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,把手给我 放我肩膀上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give me your arm. Up over my shoulder.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.60,1:08:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,准备好了? 来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready? There we go.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.34,1:08:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,等我离开这之后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When I get out of here
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.75,1:09:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我想我要去打个炮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I'm gonna get laid.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.85,1:09:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 你可能还想先洗个澡\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. You might want to clean up a little bit first.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.96,1:09:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 等等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.93,1:09:23.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吧?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.18,1:10:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,蓝色是病毒 绿色是抗体\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Blue for the virus. Green for the antivirus.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.02,1:10:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- 有解药的 - 你说什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- There's a cure. - What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:21.39,1:10:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,有解药的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a cure.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.10,1:10:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这个过程是可逆的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The process can be reversed.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.93,1:10:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,有解药的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a cure!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.37,1:10:31.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你会好起来的!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna be okay!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.27,1:10:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我刚刚还开始担心了呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was beginning to worry.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.01,1:10:44.45,Default,,0,0,0,,T病毒就是存放在这的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is where they kept the T-virus.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.19,1:10:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么会知道这么多?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How do you know all this?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.02,1:10:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,因为我本来想偷走它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because I was gonna steal it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.06,1:10:58.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是你妹妹的内线\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was your sister's contact.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.37,1:11:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你背叛了她 - 我不知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You betrayed her. - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:02.57,1:11:05.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- 整件事都是因为你 - 我记不起来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You caused all of this. - I can't remember.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.57,1:11:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我事实\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.21,1:11:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经不记得事实了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't remember the truth.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.61,1:11:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我就不明白了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't understand!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.35,1:11:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,它不见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.48,1:11:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,它不在这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not there.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.75,1:11:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,撑不住了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.36,1:11:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经撑不住了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I just can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.69,1:11:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,快完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's over.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.83,1:12:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以帮你拿到病毒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can help you get the virus.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.94,1:12:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我能搞到安全密码 监控图 还有计划\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have access to security codes, surveillance plans, the works.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:14.87,1:12:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,但是需要一些价码\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But there's gonna be a price.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:17.01,1:12:19.03,Default,,0,0,0,,说吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Name it.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.11,1:12:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,向我保证你会把这组织给摧毁了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have to guarantee me that you will bring this corporation down.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.90,1:12:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,斯宾塞? 斯宾塞?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spence? Spence?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.82,1:13:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.83,1:13:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,斯宾塞?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Spence?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.96,1:13:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我们还是有办法离开这儿的 跟我来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can still make it out of here. Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.30,1:13:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我们将可以拥有我们想要的一切\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can have everything we've ever wanted.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.64,1:13:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,大把钞票在外面等着我们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Money's out there waiting.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.27,1:13:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你绝对想不到有多少\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You wouldn't believe how much.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:56.38,1:13:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你以为这样子我的梦想就会实现了吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is that how you thought all my dreams were gonna come true?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.98,1:14:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.48,1:14:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想开枪打死你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wouldn't want to shoot you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:05.48,1:14:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,那些子弹可能还用得着呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Might need the bullets.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.56,1:14:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,退后\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back off.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:15.86,1:14:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会拿一分钱的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I won't take any part in this.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.20,1:14:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊 不过你不可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, but you can't just
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.07,1:14:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,这么简单就脱离干系的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}wash your hands of this.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.20,1:14:26.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我们为同一家公司效力 你知道他们做了些什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We work for the same company. You knew what they did.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.24,1:14:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我在试着阻止他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was trying to stop them.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.41,1:14:31.84,Default,,0,0,0,,你真觉得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You really believe that
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.41,1:14:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,像他这种人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}people like him
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.91,1:14:37.35,Default,,0,0,0,,能改变任何事情?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}will ever change anything?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.80,1:14:39.35,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.75,1:14:40.91,Default,,0,0,0,,什么都\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.99,1:14:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,不会改变\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}ever changes.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.76,1:14:47.35,Default,,0,0,0,,解毒血清\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.53,1:14:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,在哪里?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the antivirus?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.70,1:14:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,在你找到我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's on the train
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.00,1:14:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,那辆火车上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}where you found me.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.00,1:14:59.97,Default,,0,0,0,,离它绝对没有三尺远\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Couldn't have been standing more than three feet from it.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.27,1:15:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我差点就出去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I so nearly made it out.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.78,1:15:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,没想到那贱逼电脑居然在蜂巢外面有防卫系统\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Didn't realize that bitch of a computer had defense systems outside the Hive.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.82,1:15:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,同意还是拒绝?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In or out?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.55,1:15:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,同意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.32,1:15:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,还是拒绝?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or out?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.89,1:15:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道我们有过什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know what we had
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.79,1:15:22.82,Default,,0,0,0,,可现在结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but it's over.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.70,1:15:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.64,1:15:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,他妈的后退\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the fuck off.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.65,1:15:48.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经开始怀念你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm missing you already.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.10,1:16:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你男朋友还真是个人渣\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your boyfriend's a real asshole.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.37,1:16:02.83,Default,,0,0,0,,他把锁给打坏了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He shot the locking mechanism out.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.90,1:16:07.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我不敢相信那贱人居然就这么跑了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't believe that son of a bitch is gonna get away with this.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.71,1:16:09.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我不这么觉得\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.21,1:16:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我可一向是个坏女孩喔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've been a bad, bad girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.24,1:17:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,噢 我的天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.12,1:17:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,那他妈是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the fuck is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.63,1:17:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,蜂巢早期的一个试验品\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}One of the Hive's early experiments
Dialogue: 0,1:17:37.40,1:17:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,通过把T病毒直接注入活的细胞组织产生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}produced by injecting the T-virus directly into living tissue.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.50,1:17:44.44,Default,,0,0,0,,结果很不稳定\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The results were unstable.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:44.50,1:17:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,现在吃掉新的DNA后 它将会突变\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now that it has fed on fresh DNA, it will mutate
Dialogue: 0,1:17:55.88,1:17:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,变成更强 更快的猎手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}becoming a stronger, faster hunter.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.65,1:18:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,真棒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Great.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.82,1:18:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道它逃跑了 为什么不警告我们?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you knew it was loose, why didn't you warn us?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.96,1:18:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,因为这是她专门留给咱们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}'Cause she was saving it for us.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.10,1:18:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,对不对?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Isn't that right?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:11.30,1:18:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有想到你们会活到现在\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I didn't think any of you would make it this far.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:14.80,1:18:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,就是没被感染也不可能\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not without infection.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.37,1:18:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么不告诉我们有抗病毒血清?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why didn't you tell us about the antivirus?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:20.04,1:18:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,被感染了这么长时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This long after infection
Dialogue: 0,1:18:22.07,1:18:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,血清不一定会管用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}there's no guarantee it would work.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.04,1:18:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,但是还有机会 对吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But there's a chance, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.82,1:18:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我不做有风险的交易\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't deal in chance.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.36,1:18:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,去你妈的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fuck it.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.77,1:18:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,没时间了 伙计们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No pressure, guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.41,1:18:57.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你们需要4位数的密码\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You require the four digit access code.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.74,1:19:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以给你们密码 但你们必须先为我做件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can give you the code, but first you must do something for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.88,1:19:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你想要什么? - 你们中有人被感染了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What do you want? - One of your group is infected.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.88,1:19:08.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我要她的命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I require her life for the code.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.95,1:19:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,抗病毒血清的药就在平台上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The antivirus is right there on the platform.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.89,1:19:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 就在那里! - 对不起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It's right there! - I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.29,1:19:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我无法承担的风险\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a risk I cannot take.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.07,1:19:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,她说得对\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:21.90,1:19:22.96,Default,,0,0,0,,那是唯一的办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the only way.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.03,1:19:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你得杀了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're gonna have to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.13,1:19:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.74,1:19:31.30,Default,,0,0,0,,要不我们都会死在这里.\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Otherwise we all die down here.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.38,1:19:39.91,Default,,0,0,0,,玻璃是加固过的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The glass is reinforced
Dialogue: 0,1:19:39.99,1:19:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,但是不会永远不破\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but it won't hold forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.53,1:19:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- 动手吧 - 不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do it. - No.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.39,1:19:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 起来 - 只管动手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get up. - Just do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.96,1:19:52.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- 雷恩 赶快起来 - 动手!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Rain, please get up. - Do it!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.13,1:19:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你没多少时间下决定了 - 起来 求你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You don't have long to decide. - Get up, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.47,1:19:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你没有选择了 - 杀了她\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You have no choice. - Kill her.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.17,1:19:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,现在就杀了她 你没有任何选择余地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kill her now. You don't have any choice.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.94,1:20:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 快点动手! - 我办不到!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Just do it now! - I can't!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.77,1:20:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- 求求你 - 动手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Please. - Do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.64,1:20:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 杀了她 - 只管动手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Kill her. - Just do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.11,1:20:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,现在就杀了她!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kill her now!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.92,1:20:11.85,Default,,0,0,0,,杀了她!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kill her!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.95,1:20:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,这婊子不肯开门 所以我只好把她给烧焦了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The bitch wouldn't open the door, so I had to fry her.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.49,1:20:48.45,Default,,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.30,1:20:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,那他妈是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What the fuck was that?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:59.40,1:21:01.33,Default,,0,0,0,,说来话长\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a long story.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.45,1:21:21.89,Default,,0,0,0,,启动它\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Start it up.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:22.95,1:21:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我去拿病毒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll get the virus.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:00.53,1:22:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经开始怀念你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm missing you already.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:08.10,1:22:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,好 我们上路了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay, we're in business.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.97,1:22:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,全速前进\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Full power.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.80,1:22:14.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要走了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're leaving!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:31.29,1:22:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想变成那些玩意中的一个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't want to be one of those things
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.03,1:22:39.83,Default,,0,0,0,,四处游荡没有灵魂\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}walking around without a soul.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.57,1:22:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你不会的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You won't.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.74,1:22:45.67,Default,,0,0,0,,等时候到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When the time comes
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.14,1:22:49.33,Default,,0,0,0,,你来解决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you'll take care of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.18,1:22:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,没人会死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one else is gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.25,1:22:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,好吗?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:05.36,1:23:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.36,1:24:11.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我还没死呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not dead yet.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.22,1:24:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我想还是把枪拿回来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I'll have that back.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.06,1:24:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我真想亲你一口 小婊砸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could kiss you, you bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.67,1:24:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,后面出什么事了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on back there?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.72,1:24:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,- 赶快把我们带出去! - 再快的话 我们就要脱轨了!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get us the fuck out of here! - Any faster, we'll come off the rails!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.10,1:26:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,开门!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open the doors!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.26,1:26:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,开门!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open the doors!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.03,1:26:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,快!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:13.23,1:28:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我辜负了所有人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I failed all of them.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.50,1:28:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我搞砸了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I failed.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.77,1:28:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.34,1:28:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你已经尽力了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is nothing else you could've done.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.01,1:28:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,是公司的错 不是你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The corporation's guilty here, not you.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:28.51,1:28:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,而且我们终于有了证据\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we finally have the proof.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:31.08,1:28:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,保护伞公司不可能有办法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That way Umbrella can't get
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.42,1:28:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,逃脱干系了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}get away with this.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.66,1:28:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.56,1:28:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你被感染了 但你会没事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're infected, but you're gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.16,1:28:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我不要失去你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not losing you.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.97,1:28:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,救命!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.38,1:28:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,救救他 你们在干什么?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help him. What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.26,1:29:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,马特!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Matt!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.32,1:29:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,他在突变\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's mutating.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.13,1:29:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我要让他进入复仇女神项目\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want him in the Nemesis Program.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.47,1:29:24.96,Default,,0,0,0,,滚开!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get off!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.17,1:29:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,这是怎么了?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.14,1:29:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,马特!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Matt!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.86,1:29:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,把她隔离起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want her quarantined.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.37,1:29:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,严密观察 并且对血液进行全面检测\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Close observation and a full series of blood tests.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.54,1:30:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,看她是不是被感染了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let's see if she's infected.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.11,1:30:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,把她带到浣熊市的研究所\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take her to the Raccoon City facility.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.64,1:30:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,然后组织一个小队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then assemble the team.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.65,1:30:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要重新打开蜂巢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're reopening the Hive.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:10.25,1:30:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我想知道下面发生了什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want to know what went on down there.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.15,1:30:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,赶快行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.49,1:31:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,谁在里面?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's in there?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.76,1:31:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,让我出去!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me out!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:34.27,1:31:35.70,Default,,0,0,0,,让我出去!\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me out!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:37.03,1:31:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,,谁在里面?\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who's in there?
